引廻し、大事","ts":"1634386737.096900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ltSH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97100906-7627-4a05-a418-f0074fa73f55","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ちなみに積んだパスコンは2つ目なんですよ。","ts":"1634386038.094700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FmhWY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b2e8d4f0-84da-4150-a039-c348746b8261","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"現時点までの推測なんですが、マイコン(LED)が電源ラインに出す動作ノイズが、並走するデータラインへクロストークしてデータ化けを起こしたと考えてます。","ts":"1634386000.094400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CdZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f466a5b-2b6e-4692-8df0-4cb1c42aa0fd","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"デイジーチェーンの遠い側で不安定になりやすい、とか傾向があるなら信号配線のノイズ対策が必要かもですね（たぶん電力の問題っぽい気がするけど）","ts":"1634381707.092600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7eP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d95869a9-5d02-45a2-b38c-7ea7dff34b18","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"LED点灯のための電力が足りないのか電源が不安定でマイコン動作に影響出てるのかどっちかなと思ったけど、根本に\n大きめのパスコンいれて安定するなら電力供給の問題だったのかな","ts":"1634381505.090900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HYac0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"928f4395-963f-4baa-886d-21a9adc7a76f","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"データシートには100nFで例示されているようだ","ts":"1634380269.087000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1fu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3651c8f2-ed89-4a0b-92c0-905cacd99275","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あーこれ前に教えてもらったマイコン内蔵LEDなんですね\nちゃんとやるならLEDそれぞれにパスコン要りそう","ts":"1634380049.086100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V/L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9aa1f27c-2b63-47db-a3a5-a7345053c265","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"電力供給がギリ足りないんですかね","ts":"1634379576.084600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+/Q6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7008b786-7e46-4363-928b-112e666bbcbc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"見た目なんか不安になるw","ts":"1634379543.084000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JwuY9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e02873a-ea7a-46bd-929c-2c64f492104b","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"パスコンをスパコンに空目して、こんなに小さいスパコンあるのかと思ってしまった","ts":"1634379464.083700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sAE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0fbe8d4-b21e-4515-8511-3c3948b0818a","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"やりました。\n\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1449314782687875074\u003e","ts":"1634379124.082800","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/kaoriya|@kaoriya\u003e: ここに無理やりパスコン挟んだらLED安定したよ! \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FB0AHQDUYAIqlXi.jpg\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"MURAOKA Taro","author_subname":"@kaoriya","author_link":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1449314782687875074","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1196794099/avatar_normal.JPEG","text":"ここに無理やりパスコン挟んだらLED安定したよ! \u003chttps://pbs.twimg.com/media/FB0AHQDUYAIqlXi.jpg\u003e","image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/FB0AHQDUYAIqlXi.jpg","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1634378545,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1449314782687875074","original_url":"https://twitter.com/kaoriya/status/1449314782687875074"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+89"}]},{"client_msg_id":"47a4a3ca-16ff-4183-98ba-29072a0d15f8","type":"me